title: The Center
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: never
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; center_timer += 6
card-image: img/HilferdingRudolf.jpg

= The Center

The Center faction is the glue that holds our party together. How shall we make use of their talents?

-	@use_hilferding: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Rudolf Hilferding
-	@use_wels: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Otto Wels
-	@use_vogel: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Hans Vogel
-	@use_muller: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Hermann Müller
-	@use_breitscheid: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Rudolf Breitscheid
-	@use_baade: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Fritz Baade
-	@use_hirschfeld: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Magnus Hirschfeld
-	@use_radbruch: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Gustav Radbruch
-	@use_stampfer: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Friedrich Stampfer
- @use_lobe: We will use the talents of the Center leader, Paul Löbe
- @boost_center_influence_subtle: We will subtly promote the Center faction as not to anger any of the other factions.
- @boost_center_influence_blatant: We will openly promote the Center faction.
- @party_discipline: We will use the Center’s connections to reduce dissent across the party.
- @toleration: We will use the Center’s connections to defend toleration.
- @weimar_relations: We will use the Center’s connections to further relations with the Weimar parties, Zentrum and the DDP.
- @reduce_center_dissent: We will work to reduce dissent within the faction.
- @new_center_leader: [+ center_leader +] has served well, but new leadership is required.
- @root: We will do none of these things.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@use_lobe
view-if: center_leader == "Löbe"
go-to: lobe

@use_hilferding
view-if: center_leader == "Hilferding"
go-to: hilferding

@use_wels
view-if: center_leader == "Wels"
go-to: wels

@use_vogel
view-if: center_leader == "Vogel"
go-to: vogel

@use_muller
view-if: center_leader == "Müller"
go-to: muller

@use_breitscheid
view-if: center_leader == "Breitscheid"
go-to: breitscheid

@use_baade
view-if: center_leader == "Baade"
go-to: baade

@use_hirschfeld
view-if: center_leader == "Hirschfeld"
go-to: hirschfeld

@use_radbruch
view-if: center_leader == "Rabdruch"
go-to: radbruch

@use_stampfer
view-if: center_leader == "Stampfer"
go-to: stampfer

@boost_center_influence_subtle
on-arrival: center_strength += 5; center_dissent -= 3

We have made subtle moves to boost the popularity of the Center faction.

@boost_center_influence_blatant
on-arrival: center_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 5; left_dissent += 3; labor_dissent += 3; reformist_dissent += 3

We have openly promoted the Center faction, to the anger of the other factions.

@party_discipline
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have used the Center’s connections to reduce dissent across all factions.

@toleration
view-if: spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 1
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5;

We have used the Center’s connections to reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions.

@weimar_relations
on-arrival: z_relation += 10; ddp_relation += 10

We have used the Center’s connections to boost relations with the Zentrum and DDP.

@reduce_center_dissent
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 10

We have worked to reduce dissent within the Center faction.

@new_center_leader

We must now select a new leader for the Center Faction.

- @center_leader_hilferding:
- @center_leader_wels
- @center_leader_vogel
- @center_leader_muller
- @center_leader_breitscheid
- @center_leader_baade
- @center_leader_hirschfeld
- @center_leader_radbruch
- @center_leader_stampfer
- @center_leader_lobe
- @root: We have changed our minds.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@center_leader_hilferding
title: Rudolf Hilferding
subtitle: Rudolf Hilferding is an economist and one of our chief Marxist theoreticians.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/HilferdingRudolf.jpg
view-if: center_leader != "Hilferding" and spd_coleader_1 != "Hilferding" and spd_coleader_2 != "Hilferding" and spd_coleader_3 != "Hilferding"
on-arrival: center_leader = "Hilferding"; center_leader_fullname = "Rudolf Hilferding"
go-to: death_of_levi if succession_levi == 1; death_of_muller if succession_muller == 1

Rudolf Hilferding has been agreed as faction leader.

@center_leader_wels
title: Otto Wels
subtitle: Otto Wels is a long-time party organizer and member of the leadership, serving under Friedrich Ebert.
